[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chrystianfarias/SailingTogether/main/docs/cover.jpg[/img][/center]

[size=4][b]Description[/b][/size]
[size=3]In vanilla Valheim only the player at the helm can move the ship. With [b]SailingTogether[/b], every player [b]sitting on a ship bench[/b] can row with [b]W[/b] (forward) and [b]S[/b] (backward) instead of standing up — [b]Jump[/b] still stands you up.

Each side of the ship pushes independently, so your crew can go straight, turn or spin the ship in place — together.[/size]

[size=4][b]Installation instructions[/b][/size]
[size=3][list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://thunderstore.io/c/valheim/p/denikson/BepInExPack_Valheim/]BepInExPack Valheim[/url] and run the game once, so the [i]BepInEx[/i] folder is created.
[*][b]Vortex:[/b] install the main file with Vortex.
[b]Manual:[/b] extract the zip into the Valheim folder. It contains [i]BepInEx/plugins/SailingTogether/SailingTogether.dll[/i].
[*]Start the game. The BepInEx log should show [i]SailingTogether 1.0.0 loaded.[/i]
[/list]
The config file [i]BepInEx/config/farias.SailingTogether.cfg[/i] is created on first run.[/size]

[size=4][b]Main features[/b][/size]
[size=3][b]Cooperative rowing[/b]
[list]
[*]Works at [b]speed 1 (oars)[/b] and in reverse. Optionally also while stopped ([i]RowInStop[/i]), which allows rowing with nobody at the helm.
[*]Each rower pushes on the side of the ship they are sitting on:
[/list]
[code]
 Left | Right | Result
------+-------+-----------------------------
  W   |   W   | straight, faster
  W   |   -   | turns right
  -   |   W   | turns left
  W   |   S   | spins in place to the right
  S   |   S   | brakes / goes backward
[/code]
[list]
[*]A bench on the ship's centerline only pushes, it does not turn the ship.
[*]The helmsman keeps full control of speed and rudder; the rowers' force is added on top.
[/list]

[b]Ship HUD[/b]
[list]
[*]Top-down view of the ship in the lower-right corner, built from the game's own icons.
[*][b]Helmsman:[/b] sees every bench, who is sitting and each rower's direction.
[*][b]Rower:[/b] sees only their own bench and rowing direction.
[*]Animated oars that sway like the vanilla helm oar, plus green (W) / red (S) arrows outside the hull.
[/list]

[b]Multiplayer[/b]
[list]
[*]Each rower's input is synced through their own player data — no extra network traffic.
[*]Ship physics runs on the ship's owner, using that player's config values.
[/list]

[b]Configurable[/b]
[list]
[*]Rowing power, turn acceleration, maximum turn rate and center dead zone.
[*]Rowing while stopped / in reverse.
[*]HUD on/off, scale and position.
[*]Optional rower simulator (F8, disabled by default) for testing alone.
[/list][/size]

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[size=3][list]
[*][b]BepInEx is required:[/b] [url=https://thunderstore.io/c/valheim/p/denikson/BepInExPack_Valheim/]BepInExPack Valheim[/url] 5.4.x.
[*][b]Every player on the ship must have the mod installed.[/b]
[/list][/size]

